{
    "title": "Dayuse: Hotel rooms by day",
    "description": "Could booking a hotel \u2018by the night\u2019 be a thing of the past? Dayuse is shaking up the hotel industry by making hotel rooms and services available to guests in the middle of the day and allowing hoteliers to unlock additional sources of revenue. \r\n \r\nWorking with over 7,000 hotel partners in over 26 countries and 500 cities. From a \u2018daycation\u2019 close to home to a last-minute meeting, now there\u2019s a new way to enjoy a hotel experience. Dayuse opens up a whole world of possibilities, where users get more out of their stay and hoteliers get more out of their opening hours.\r\n\r\nWhy book a hotel for a few hours during the day? \r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a new type of workspace or a quiet, private space in which to recharge your batteries, Dayuse.com is the must-have app for a different kind of hotel experience. \r\nWhether it\u2019s an office for a digital nomad or a lovers\u2019 nest you\u2019re after, hotels can provide valuable private space to meet your every need during the daytime.\r\n\r\nHow do I go about booking a hotel room for a few hours? \r\n\r\nThe Dayuse app has been designed to make it easier for you to book a hotel room during the day. Intuitive and ergonomic, it displays all of the practical information about a hotel on a single page, including prices, booking hours and access, all at the click of a button. \r\n\r\nThe first step? Find a room that\u2019s available to book for just a few hours at a day hotel in your city. \r\nWhat next? Select a time slot that suits you and make the booking! You will not need a credit card to make the booking. \r\n\r\nAs part of your Dayuse experience, you\u2019ll not only have access to your hotel room for a few hours but also to all of the services that a hotel might offer, including Wi-Fi, a gym, a pool, a spa, etc. \r\n\r\nHow do I cancel a Dayuse booking? \r\n\r\nIt's very simple - you can cancel a Dayuse booking right up until the last minute! \r\n\r\nDayuse. Room to Daydream. \r\n\r\nThere are a thousand and one reasons for booking a day room or a hotel by the hour. Don't miss out on this trendy new way to bring that element of enjoyment to every moment of your day! Dayuse.com offers hourly and daily hotel reservations in chic boutique hotels and 4 and 5-star hotels located in the most popular neighbourhoods. \r\n\r\nWhether you need a room for the day, for the afternoon or for a lunch break, you\u2019ll always find a Dayuse.com day hotel nearby to accommodate your needs. \r\n\r\nDayuse.com, the leading daytime hotel booking platform, will soon have you falling in love with the concept of daybreak hotels, which are perfect for the following: \r\nWorking in a quiet environment at a daybreak hotel\r\nHaving access to a one-off office or co-working space for a few hours\r\nOrganising a photo shoot or an interview \r\nRecharging your batteries with a much-needed nap\r\nTurning your stopover into an enjoyable experience \r\nTreating yourself to a luxury hotel at an affordable price \r\nEnjoying a staycation \r\nTaking advantage of the hotel's facilities: spa, swimming pool, gym, etc. \r\n\r\nMake the most of your future daycation by booking your day hotel today using the Dayuse.com app. Book with confidence, with no credit card required. You may cancel your booking free of charge up until the last minute.",
